1
00:00:05,477 --> 00:00:06,477
Yubin,

2
00:00:06,752 --> 00:00:08,752
things got hectic right
after you joined, huh?

3
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:12,429
Thanks for keeping up. You've been great.

4
00:00:12,429 --> 00:00:13,734
Thank you.

5
00:00:17,816 --> 00:00:19,918
Eunwoo, you've been amazing too.

6
00:00:20,235 --> 00:00:21,786
Our launch is just around the corner.

7
00:00:22,513 --> 00:00:23,651
Hang in there, okay?

8
00:00:23,923 --> 00:00:24,923
Got it.

9
00:00:26,287 --> 00:00:27,287
Shall we toast?

10
00:00:27,538 --> 00:00:29,879
Cheers!

11
00:00:41,728 --> 00:00:43,046
Yubin's drunk.

12
00:00:45,901 --> 00:00:46,901
Already?

13
00:00:47,753 --> 00:00:49,126
Yeah, she's a lightweight.

14
00:00:50,775 --> 00:00:51,775
You know her well.

15
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:54,450
Yeah right, as if you know me that well.

16
00:01:08,194 --> 00:01:09,194
Unnie

17
00:01:11,207 --> 00:01:12,418
Are you really dating someone?

18
00:01:13,228 --> 00:01:14,228
Again with that?

19
00:01:16,196 --> 00:01:17,196
No, it's just...

20
00:01:17,651 --> 00:01:19,561
your vibe's been brighter lately.

21
00:01:25,510 --> 00:01:26,510
What about you, Yubin?

22
00:01:28,509 --> 00:01:30,617
Are you seeing someone?

23
00:01:37,702 --> 00:01:38,702
Actually,

24
00:01:39,021 --> 00:01:41,111
I was in love with someone
for a really long time.

25
00:01:44,441 --> 00:01:47,662
Like, the kind of love where you wait,

26
00:01:48,234 --> 00:01:49,994
thinking one day they
might finally see you.

27
00:01:50,544 --> 00:01:52,023
I was always waiting,

28
00:01:52,946 --> 00:01:55,718
always giving in.

29
00:01:57,684 --> 00:01:59,415
But turns out,

30
00:02:00,823 --> 00:02:03,039
that day never comes
if you just stay still.

31
00:02:06,185 --> 00:02:07,185
So

32
00:02:07,809 --> 00:02:09,378
I made a decision.

33
00:02:12,411 --> 00:02:14,321
From now on,

34
00:02:16,642 --> 00:02:17,906
From now on,

35
00:02:21,034 --> 00:02:22,441
I won't give in anymore.

36
00:02:23,267 --> 00:02:24,746
If I like someone,

37
00:02:27,904 --> 00:02:29,168
I'll just go for it.

38
00:02:35,165 --> 00:02:36,734
Yubin, you are drunk.

39
00:02:37,966 --> 00:02:38,966
Let go, let go.

40
00:02:41,867 --> 00:02:45,771
Go lie down on the couch and rest.
